### Health check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

### Login as admin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@jobconnect.dev",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Login as job seeker
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "michael@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Admin ping WITH admin token
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/ping
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### Admin ping WITH seeker token
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/ping
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_SEEKER_TOKEN_HERE

### Admin ping WITHOUT token
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/ping